 "answer_verbatim": "A good starting point is **American Construction Inc.** It handles remodeling and general construction in Joplin, and says it has served the area since 1993. The BBB listing shows an **A+ rating** and gives its number as **(417) 781-6811**. [Company site](https://www.americanconstructionincorporated.com/) · [BBB listing](https://www.bbb.org/us/mo/joplin/category/home-renovation)\n\nFor another option, **GRC General Construction** is listed by the BBB for remodeling and general contracting in the Joplin area, with an **A+ rating**: **(417) 499-7424**. [BBB listing](https://www.bbb.org/us/mo/joplin/category/home-renovation)\n\nThose are useful leads, not guarantees. Before hiring, get at least three written bids, ask for recent references and proof of insurance, and make sure the contract spells out scope, payment schedule, permits, and change-order terms.",
